<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How YToMP4 handles your data: no accounts, no conversion history, temporary files deleted automatically." updated="October 11, 2026">
  <p>YToMP4 ("we", "us") operates ytomp4.com. This policy explains what information we process when you use the YouTube to MP4 and MP3 converter.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Links you submit.</strong> The YouTube URL is used only to perform the conversion you request. We do not store a history of the links you convert.</li>
    <li><strong>Converted files.</strong> MP4 and MP3 files are stored temporarily so you can download them and are deleted automatically shortly afterwards.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider may process IP addresses and basic request logs to deliver the service and protect it from abuse.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not require an account, email address or payment.</li>
    <li>We do not sell personal data.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (provided by Google LLC) to understand how visitors use the site, for example which pages are visited and which formats are converted, so we can improve the service. Analytics cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>) are only set after you click <strong>Accept</strong> in the cookie banner.</p>
  <p>If you reject, or before you choose, Google Consent Mode sends cookieless, aggregated measurements without identifiers. We do not use advertising cookies, and we do not share analytics data for advertising.</p>
  <p>Your choice is stored in your browser (localStorage). You can change it at any time via <a href="#consent" data-open-consent>Cookie settings</a> in the footer. See also <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses data from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
